<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (Considered the first modern mercenary war. Mercenaries supported by western countries fought to defend mining interests in the natural resource-rich country of Congo by fighting the Soviet Union. This helped stop rapidly spreading Soviet influence in Africa. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
